3名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 96px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;
16,800千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 167.46666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;うち社外2名11,400千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 96px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;合計&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 96px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;7名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 96px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;150,812千円&lt;/p&gt;
